        "slc_c349a6ffd7aa6f5f19ff3558791e459042be9e4be43cc4eff8f4ad81be24bf8a"
      ],
      "text": "The primary users are non-technical builders with no coding background running Dyad locally on Mac or Windows; a secondary audience brings their own API keys and local models."
    },
