      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_af09ce1abc9d307c05940ee8d18425a528535fc348816f7794959cd18940b56b"
      ],
      "text": "The local agent's core loop lives in src/pro/main/ipc/handlers/local_agent/local_agent_handler.ts, calling the LLM until it stops making tool calls or hits a per-turn maximum step count; tool_definitions.ts lists the agent's tools."
    },
